  usecase "AIFR003: Generate Spending Limit Alerts for Users Identifying Unusual Deviations from Established Spending Patterns" as AIFR003
  usecase "AIFR004: Generate Investment Opportunity Analyses for Users Evaluating Potential Investments Against Their Risk Profiles Time Horizons and Financial Goals" as AIFR004
  usecase "AIFR005: Generate Investment Opportunities for Users Identifying Financial Instruments That Align with Their Investment Strategies and Modern Portfolio Theory Principles" as AIFR005
  usecase "AIFR006: Generate Anomaly Transaction Alerts By Employing Pattern Recognition to Detect Potentially Fraudulent Activities in Compliance With FinCEN Requirements" as AIFR006
  usecase "AIFR007: Generate Contextualized News Insights Correlating Financial News with Specific User Portfolios Identifying Relevant Impacts" as AIFR007
  usecase "AIFR008: Generate Client Predictive Intervention Recommendations By Identifying Patterns That Indicate Potential Financial Difficulties or Opportunities Requiring Advisor Engagement" as AIFR008
